Verdict: **do not merge or install yet**. The three high-severity defects are:

- Draft entries lose selected equipment context.
- D28 can omit a user-authored exercise-to-seeded-model link.
- Embedded CRLF text can corrupt the CSV structure.

The review includes the full schema audit, D28 edge cases, test gaps, UI/staging assessment, and smallest fixes. No product code was changed. Tests/builds could not be independently run because the sandbox cannot access CoreSimulatorService.
